<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="GAL" style="id">- Borna New Testamnet</book>
  <para style="h">Gelati</para>
  <para style="toc2">Gelati</para>
  <para style="toc1">Gelati Maants</para>
  <para style="toc3">Gel.</para>
  <para style="mt3">Wosheetso P'awlos Wosho</para>
  <para style="mt">Gelati Ashuwots Maants</para>
  <para style="imt">Kindo</para>
  <para style="ip">Iyesus kashyo keewiru doo shishiyosh aap'etso jamoke nabfere ayhudi woteraw ashuwots dek'fere bo ami taawo «Kristiyani wotosh Muse nemo s'eentso geyifamó geyiratsa?» Etiru aato tuutni b́ tesh, múk'ef Isiyotsere Rom shirootsts Gelatyon fa'a Ik'i moowwotsitse «Asho Ik' shinatse b́ kááwish Iyesus s'uzn aman b́ woterawo Muse weeron imets nemo koto bín geyife» ett P'awlosi k'efiru ashuwots faa'ano bo tesh.</para>
  <para style="ip">P'awlos Gelati ashuwots maants woshan b́ guut' dananatse tuutso dandts ashuwotsi arik wotts imnetiyonat Krstiyaniyi beyo maants jishosha, P'awlos Iyesus Krstossh woshek b́ wotoko kitsone b́ tuwi, woshetsosh bín s'eegtso Ik'a bako ash wotb́k'azok'onat b́ woshewonu Ayhudi woteraw ashuwotsok b́ wotok'o ik ikon b́ daniyi, s'uwaatsi k'ot'wotsitsnowere Krstiyani beyo Iyesusi amannon daatseyiru shunotse t'úptso b́ wotok'oniye b́ kitsiri.</para>
  <para style="iot">Jamon mas'aafan b́detstso</para>
  <para style="io1">Kindo 1:1-10</para>
  <para style="io1">Wosheetso P'awlos b́ detsts alo 1:11—2:21</para>
  <para style="io1">Ik' deeri doo shishiyo 3:1—4:31</para>
  <para style="io1">Krstiyani nas' keshonat k'alosh boon geyit keewo 5:1—6:10</para>
  <para style="io1">Gúúpo 6:1-18</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="GAL 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 1:1"/>Ashuwotsoke wee ash weeron b́ woterawo Iyesus Krstosnat bín k'irotse tizts Ik'o nihon wosheetso wotat wosheetso taa P'awlosoke, <verse eid="GAL 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 1:2"/>Tiyoke fa'a eshú jamwotsoke Gelati Ik'i moowwotssh wosheetso.<verse eid="GAL 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 1:3"/>No nihi Ik'okere, no doonz Iyesus Krstos s'aatonat jeenon itsh wotowe.<verse eid="GAL 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 1:4"/>Gond dúranitse noon kashiyosh noko Izar Izewernat no nihi bí eektsosh Krstos no morrosh b́ tooko beshidek't b́ imi. <verse eid="GAL 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 1:5"/>Dúre dúrosh b́ borfetso Ik'osh mango wotowe! Amen.<verse eid="GAL 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Arik wotts doo shishiyo Ik s'uzo b́wottsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 1:6"/>Krstos s'aaton itn s'eegtso Izar Izeweratse káári it k'aletsonat k'osh doo shishiyo maants it aantsok'o taane bí adiri. <verse eid="GAL 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 1:7"/>Hanowere ti etir itn dandirwotsnat Krstos doo shishiyonowere k'uriyosh geyiru ik ik ashuwots bobetsosha bako doo shishiyoniyere shinoor ik s'uzee. <verse eid="GAL 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 1:8"/>Wotowa eree noon wotowá, daratsi melakiyo wotowa, no nonabtsonton gáwet k'osh doo shishiyo itsh nabitwo c'ashek wotowe! <verse eid="GAL 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 1:9"/>Haniyere shini t ettsok'o andoru aani eteetwe, it it dek'tsonton ik woteraw doo shishiyo konworu itsh b́ nabiyal c'ashek wotowe!<verse eid="GAL 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 1:10"/>Bére, taa t geyir asho taan b́ úditwok'owemó? Ik'o taan b́ úditwok'owe? Himó ashuwotsi geneúshosh t geetsok'oweya bí ariri? Ashuwotsi geneúshosh t geyiyal Krstossh guutso woterawnk'e b́ teshi.<verse eid="GAL 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">P'awlos wosheetso wotat b́s'egeyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 1:11"/>Ti eshwwotso! taa itsh tnaabts doo shishiyo ashoke daatsek b́woterawok'o it danetwok'o geefe. <verse eid="GAL 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 1:12"/>Doo shishiyanowere Iyesus Krstosi taash bek'shi bako konoknoor de'atse, wee asho konwor taash daniratse.<verse eid="GAL 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 1:13"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:13 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="ACT 8:3">Wosh. 8:3</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 22:4-5">22:4-5</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:9-11">26:9-11</ref> </char>
    </note> Joots ayhudiwots imnetiyots tteshor aawk'o tbefok'o shishrte, Ik' moowwotsi weeralo gishefetsat t'afi bazoshe tnokorefooni. <verse eid="GAL 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 1:14"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:14 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 22:3">Wosh. 22:3</ref> </char></note> Ayhudiwots imnetiyo kotósh tdúron teshts t jir Ayhudi jamwotsiyere bogfe b́teshi, nih nihwots niwosho okoori eeno detsfe b́teshi.<verse eid="GAL 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 1:15"/>Ernmó tind maac'otse tbeefere Ik'o taan galbdek'i, b́s'aatonowere taan s'eeg b́dek'i. <verse eid="GAL 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 1:16"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:15-16 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 9:3-6">Wosh. 9:3-6</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 22:6-10">22:6-10</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:13-18">26:13-18</ref> </char></note> Ik'i ash woterawots b́ naay jangosh doo shishiyi aap'o t shishitwok'o Ik'o b́ naayi taash kitsosh b́geyor taa kontonwor shiyeratse, <verse eid="GAL 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 1:17"/>Taayere shin teshts woshetswotsi gonkeyono Iyerusalem maants amatse, ernmó shin Araawi datsomants k'az tiami, ando aaninwere Demask'o maantse k'az tiaani. <verse eid="GAL 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 1:18"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:18 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 9:26-30">Wosh. 9:26-30</ref> </char></note> Maniyehakowere keez natoniye hakon Keefi eteefo P'et'rosnton daneyosh Iyerusalem maants ti ami, manoknowere bínton tatse úúts aawo tteshi. <verse eid="GAL 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 1:19"/>Doonzo eshu Yak'obi tbek'i bako wosheets k'oshwotsitse konnor be'atse.<verse eid="GAL 1:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 1:20"/>Itsh tguut'irwan kooto b́ woterawok'o Ik' shinatse itsh katsidek' danirwe.<verse eid="GAL 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 1:21"/>Maniyere hakon Soriyi datsonat Kilk'i datso maants tiami. <verse eid="GAL 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 1:22"/>Yhud Datsatse fa'a Krstos Ik'i moowwots t shiitso bek' danakne boteshi. <verse eid="GAL 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 1:23"/>Bo boshishtsonu «Bali noon giishat teshts asho bali t'afiyosh b́geyiru imnetiyo and b́nabiri» etirwoniye. <verse eid="GAL 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 1:24"/>Ti atse tuutsonowere Ik'o boúdi.<verse eid="GAL 1:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="GAL 2"/>
  <para style="s">P'awlos woshets wottsok'o k'osh woshetswotsoke b́daneetsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 2:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:1 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="ACT 11:30">Wosh. 11:30</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 15:2">15:2</ref> </char>
    </note> Tatse awd natoniyere hakon Bernabasnton Iyerusalem maants aanat tiami, Titonowere taanton dek'at amree b́teshi. <verse eid="GAL 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 2:2"/>Man maants tiamwere Ik'o taash kitst b́bek'shtsok'onee. Haniyere shin t fintso wotowa and t fintso dats mec'r wotar b́datserawok'owa etaat Ik'i ash woterawwotssh tnabiru doo shishiyo een een wotts jishirwotssh bo aal aalshe t daniyi. <verse eid="GAL 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 2:3"/>Taanton fa'o Tito Grik dats ash b́wotiyalor gofo bíametwok'o kic'iyeeratse. <verse eid="GAL 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 2:4"/>Ernmó nodagots ááshon mut'at kindts ik ik kootets eshwots gofo bíametwok'o geeyatniye boteshi, ashaanots k'ororosh noyits mut'at bokind Krstos Iyesusn nodetsts s'ayin no keshtso bi'ide'er guutsmots noon aaniyo geeyatniye. <verse eid="GAL 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 2:5"/>Noomó doo shishiyi arikeewo itoke kup'arr b́beetwok'wa etaat dab múk' sa'atoshor ekewotssh da'eratsone.<verse eid="GAL 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 2:6"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:6 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="DEU 10:17">Iwi. 10:17</ref> </char>
    </note> Ik'o ash ááwo s'iilr b́bogabogshrawotse, jisht teshts ashaanots koni bowotiyalor bojangosh taa kic'eratse, bo taa t keewiru doo shishiy aap'ats handr keewo eegor dabraatsne. <verse eid="GAL 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 2:7"/>Ik'o P'et'rossh ayhudiwotssh doo shishi adaro b́ imetsok'on taashor doo shishi adaro Ik'i ash woterawwotssh t shishiyitwok'o b́wooshtsok'o bo t'iwintsdek'rnee, <verse eid="GAL 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 2:8"/>Mansh eshe P'et'rosi ayhudiwotssh wosheetso wotar b́finitwok'o woshtso Izar Izewer taanor Ik' ash woterawwotssh wosheetso wotar t finitwok'o woshre. <verse eid="GAL 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 2:9"/>Irok'o araat be'eyiru jishirwots Yak'obnat P'et'rosu, Yohanswere Ik'i s'aaton k'osh wotts fini gowan taash b́ imtsok'o bodantsosh taanat Bernabasnton ik bowoti milikit wottso bok'ani kisho noosh imrne, shiyeyat no Ik' ash woterawwotsok no ametuwok'o boowere Ayihudiyots maants bo ametuwok'o bok'ali. <verse eid="GAL 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 2:10"/>S'uznmó bo dagotse fa'a tuguretswotsi no baterawok'o noosh oona etrne, hanwere arikon k'alosh t geef keewoniye.<verse eid="GAL 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">P'awlos Ans'okiyon P'et'rosi b́k'eftsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 2:11"/>P'et'ros Soriyotse fa'a Ans'okiyo maants b́ woor dart b́ teshtsotse b́ shinatsere bín t k'efi, <verse eid="GAL 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 2:12"/>Yak'ob b́ woshts ik ik ashuwots Ans'okiyo maants bowaafetsere shin Ik' ash woteraw ashuwotsitsere amantsuwotsnton towaat mááfetsetni b́ teshi, bo boweyiyakonomó, «Ik' ash woteraw jirwotsitsere amantsuwots gof amo boosh geyife<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:12 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Gof amo boosh geyife: </char><char style="ft">Etrwots ayhudiyotsi bo wotok'oni b́ kitsiri. </char></note>» etiru jirwotsn shatt shuutso maants aanat Ik' ash woterawwotsatse b́ galeyi. <verse eid="GAL 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 2:13"/>K'osh ayhudi jir wotts Krstiyaniwotswor ayhudi woterawwotsnton mish móó gond b́wottsok'o aridek't P'et'roskok'o bok'ali, Barnabasworu dab b́ oreraniyere be'eyi darman maants getseyatniye b́ teshi. <verse eid="GAL 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 2:14"/>Bo k'altsan doo shishi arikeewonton ik wotob́k'azo t bek'tsok'on P'et'rossh, «Nee ayhudi wotefetsat ayhudi nemok'on b́ woterawo Ik' ash woterawwots nemok'one n beefoni. Eshe, Ik' ash woterawwots ayhudoyots nemok'on bobetwok'o eegishe angnon n k'aliri?» etaat jami shinatse bín t k'efi.<verse eid="GAL 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ayhudyi wotowa Ik' ash woterawwotsu bokashit amanone</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 2:15"/>Arikon no noshuweyon Ayhudi noona bako morretsk wotts Ik' ash woterawwotsnonaliye. <verse eid="GAL 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 2:16"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:16 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 143:2">Dub. 143:2</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 3:20-22">Rom 3:20-22</ref> </char></note> Ernmó asho kááw b́ wotit Krstos Iyesusi amanona bako nemo s'eentson b́ woterawok'o danfone, noowere nem s'eentson b́woterawo Krstosi amanon kááw nowotitwok'o Krstos Iyesusi amanerone, konwor asho nemo s'eentsr kááw woteratse. <verse eid="GAL 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 2:17"/>Krstosi amanon kááw wotosh nogeyor no notookon morretswotsi wotar nodatsetka wotiyal eshe, morro no finitwok'o woshirwo Krstosiye eteya? mank'owiyaliye! <verse eid="GAL 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 2:18"/>Taa ttookon t gáákts nemi niwok'owa aani tfiniri wotiyal taa t tookon nemosh alerawo twotok'oniye t kitsiri etee. <verse eid="GAL 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 2:19"/>Ik'osh t beetwok'owa etaat k'irok'o k'aleyon nematse k'alere. Taa Krstosnton jitetsok'o t taawetsotse <verse eid="GAL 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 2:20"/>haniyere okoon Krstosi t gitsotse beeti bako taa t tookon beetk tanliye, and t meets atson t beyir taan shuntsonat taash b́ tooko beshidek't imts Ik' na'o amanon daatsets kashone. <verse eid="GAL 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 2:21"/>Ik' s'aato k'awntsalo oriratse, asho kááw b́ wotit nemo s'eentson b́wotiyal Krstos b́ k'ir datsmec'ra etee.<verse eid="GAL 2:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="GAL 3"/>
  <para style="s">Kááw woto b́daatset Krstosi amanon b́wottsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 3:1"/>It dárts Gelati dats ashuwotso! kone iten teziyik'ri? Iyesus Krstos it shinatse jitats jiteyat b́teshtsok'on itsh sháánidek't keewere b́teshi. <verse eid="GAL 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 3:2"/>Itoke danosh tgeyirwo han s'uziye, arikon it S'ayin shayiro it dek' nemo s'eentsoneyamó? Doo shishiyosh aap'etso shishat amanoneya? <verse eid="GAL 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 3:3"/>It Ik' shayiron dek' tuwat andmo meetson ishoshe it geyiri, eshe hanok'o dark itne. <verse eid="GAL 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 3:4"/>Doo shishi jangosh it dek'ts gond bek' jamo k'awtsalo wotat orere eteya? Han k'alrte wotiyal arikon k'awtsalko orere etee. <verse eid="GAL 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 3:5"/>Ik'o b́ shayiro itsh bí imirwonat itokere adit fino b́ finir nemok'o it finirwoshemó? Doo shishiyosh aap'etso shishat it amanirwoshe?<verse eid="GAL 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 3:6"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:6 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="GEN 15:6">Aze. 15:6</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 4:3">Rom 4:3</ref> </char>
    </note> Hanwere «Abrahamiye Ik'o b́ amani, manwere kááw wotat bísh b́ taaweyi» ett guut'etsok'one. <verse eid="GAL 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 3:7"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:7 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ROM 4:16">Rom 4:16</ref> </char></note> Eshe amanirwots Abraham nanaúwotsi bowotok'o dande'ere. <verse eid="GAL 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 3:8"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:8 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 12:3">Aze. 12:3</ref> </char></note> Ik'o Ik' ash woterawwotsi imnetiyon kááw b́ woshitwok'o S'ayin mas'aafo shino be'er «Ash jamwots neen deretúne» ett Abrahamsh shin doo shishi aap'o keewere. <verse eid="GAL 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 3:9"/>Eshe amaniru jamwots amantso Abrahamnton deretune.<verse eid="GAL 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 3:10"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:10 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="DEU 27:26">Iwi. 27:26</ref> </char>
    </note> «Nemi mas'afotsere guut'ets tzaziyi jamon kúp'ar berawonat finats jitsraw jamo c'asheke» ett guut'etsotse «Nemo finats jiitson kááwwotsi wotitwone» etirwots c'ashekne. <verse eid="GAL 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 3:11"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:11 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="HEB 2:4">Ibr. 2:4</ref> </char></note> «Kááw ashonmó imnetiyon kasho daatsitwe» ett guut'etsosh nemi fin s'eentson asho konwor Ik' shinatse kááw b́ woterawok'o daneke. <verse eid="GAL 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 3:12"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:12 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="LEV 18:5">Lew. 18:5</ref> </char></note> Nemo imnetiyats ned'iyekaliyee, mank'owere «Asho nemon beyo b́ falit nemi tzazi jamwotsi finats b́ jitsiyale» ett guut'ere.<verse eid="GAL 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 3:13"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:13 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="DEU 21:23">Iwi. 21:23</ref> </char>
    </note> «Mitats jitere k'iritu jamo c'asheke» ett guut'etsotse Krstos noosh c'ashets ash wotat nemi dowet c'ashmanitse noon b́ kishi. <verse eid="GAL 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 3:14"/>Hanwere b́ wot Ik'o Abrahamsh b́ imts deero Iyesus Krstos weeron Ik' ash woterawwotsok b́ bodetwok'onat noowere Ik'o itesh imetwe bí etts Shayiri s'ayino imnetiyon nodek'ishe.<verse eid="GAL 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nemo jangiyon aap'etso b́ gahawok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 3:15"/>T eshwotso! aab keewan ashoke daneets keewonton ik woshde'er s'iilone, ash iko b́ kindts taaro kááwar b́ ned'iyakon konwor oriyosh wee dabosh falatse. <verse eid="GAL 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 3:16"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:16 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 12:7">Aze. 12:7</ref> </char></note> Ik'o Abrahamnat b́ naarosh jangiyets aap'wotsi b́ im hank'one, jangiyon aap'etso aywotssh b́ wottsok'o woshdek't «Nnaarwotssha» eraatse, ernmó ikosh b́ wottsok'o «Nnaarosha» etfe, «Nnaara» etetsanwere Krstosiye. <verse eid="GAL 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 3:17"/>Eshe taa ti etirwo haniye, awd bale shaash natoniyere il imets nemo shino Ik'okere s'ayntsdek't imets taaro gaahr jangiyets aap'man t'afiyo falratse. <verse eid="GAL 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 3:18"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:18 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ROM 4:14">Rom 4:14</ref> </char></note> Ik keewo naatet nemok'ona wotink'ere jangit imets aap'i weeron b́ woto orere b́ teshi, ernmó Ik'o naato Abrahamsh bí'im jangit b́ aap'tsoshe.<verse eid="GAL 3:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 3:19"/>Eshe, nemo ime eegoshe? Nemo dabee Abrahamsh jangiyon imets naaro b́ wafetsosh nomrratse tuutsone, nemo melakiyo weeron beshat dagi taalotsi ash ikosh imere. <verse eid="GAL 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 3:20"/>Ernmó dagtalotse bede'er manit asho git jirosha bako ik jiro s'uzosh fineratse, Ik'onmó ike.<verse eid="GAL 3:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nemo eegosh imetsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 3:21"/>Eshe nemo Ik' jangits keewo k'efitwa? B́ jamon k'eferatse! kasho daatsit nemo imere wotink'e kááw woto nemi weerone b́ datseyak'oni b́ teshi. <verse eid="GAL 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 3:22"/>Ernmó Iyesusi amanon daatset jangets keewo amantsuwotssh imetwok'o S'ayin mas'aafo b́ etirwok'o dats jamu morrosh kéweyat morron tipetsu woterane.<verse eid="GAL 3:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 3:23"/>Imnetiyo b́ waftsere shinon nemosh tipetswotsiye noteshi, hanwere imnetiyo b́ be'efetsosh nemo noon kotdek't detsdek'tniye b́ teshi. <verse eid="GAL 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 3:24"/>Hank'on, imnetiyon kááw no wotitwok'o Krstos b́ wááfetsosh nemo noon ditsirwo wotatniye b́ teshi. <verse eid="GAL 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 3:25"/>Andomó imnetiyo b́ waatsosh nemi ditsi shirots nowoto orere.<verse eid="GAL 3:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 3:26"/>Iyesus Krstosi amanon it jametswor Ik' nanaúwotsi woterte, <verse eid="GAL 3:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GAL 3:27"/>Gúpeyon Krstosnton ik wotts it únetswots Krstosi tahok'o tahadek'rte. <verse eid="GAL 3:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GAL 3:28"/>It jametswor Krstos Iyesusn ik it wottsotse ayhudiyonat Girikiyon, gútsonat guuts woterawon, núngushonat máátson dagotse eegoru k'osh k'osheyo aaliye. <verse eid="GAL 3:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GAL 3:29"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:29 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ROM 4:13">Rom 4:13</ref> </char></note> Eshe Krstosk it wotiyakon Abraham naar itne, jangiyets aap'mank'on naatetwots itne.<verse eid="GAL 3:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="GAL 4"/>
  <para style="s">Ik' nanaúwotsi nowottsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 4:1"/>Andoor tietirwo haniye, naatetwo na'i marmat'o wotar b́ daatsewor dets jamosh doonzo b́wotiyalor guutsoniyere eegonor k'osheratse. <verse eid="GAL 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 4:2"/>Ernmó b́nih bísh b́gedts aawo b́borfetsosh ditsirwotsnat maanzirwots shirootse b́ wotiti. <verse eid="GAL 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 4:3"/>Mank'owere no shayiri keewon nana'i marmat'wotsk'o noteshor datsan niwoosh keewetswotsi wotat gutswotsiye noteshi. <verse eid="GAL 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 4:4"/>Ernmó eteets dúro b́bodtsok'on Ik'o b́naayi noosh b́woshi, bíwere nemi shirots wotat máátsatse b́shuweyi. <verse eid="GAL 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 4:5"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:5-7 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ROM 8:15-17">Rom 8:15-17</ref> </char></note> Hano b́k'al Mesee nemi shirotse teshtswotsi aani kewdek'onat noonowere Ik' nana'úwotskok'o noon woshoshe.<verse eid="GAL 4:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 4:6"/>Ik' nana'úwotsi it wottsosh Ik'o «Nihono!» ett s'eegiru naayo shayiro no nibots b́woshi. <verse eid="GAL 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 4:7"/>Mansh eshe haniyak na'a neena bako guuts neenaliye, na'a nwotiyalo Ik'atse tuutson naatetwots neene.<verse eid="GAL 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">P'awlos Gellatiyi ashuwotssh b́detsts kic'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 4:8"/>Haniye shin Ik'o it dartsatse tuutson bo doyon izar izewerotsi woterawwotssh guutso wotatni it kéweefoni. <verse eid="GAL 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 4:9"/>Andmó Ik'o danrte, dabnwor Ik'o itn danre, bere, ekeewots maawtswotsnat k'awntsal datsanatsi nemwotsok awk'oniya it aani? Aawuk'oneya ún aani aanat bo guutswotsi wotosh itgeyiri? <verse eid="GAL 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 4:10"/>K'osh k'osh aawwotsnat shashwotsn woriwoti kaywotsitsnat natwotsitse it atso kotosh k'osh wotts mango it imiri. <verse eid="GAL 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 4:11"/>It dagotse finon t maawts maaw jamo k'awntsalo oritwe etniye t shatiri.<verse eid="GAL 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 4:12"/>T eshwotso! taa itkok'o t wottsosh itwere tikok'o wotoore etaatniye t k'oniri, it taan eegoru daderatste. <verse eid="GAL 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 4:13"/>Shini doo shishiyi aap'o itsh nabosh gowo t daats t shodtsatse tuutson b́wotok'o danfte. <verse eid="GAL 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 4:14"/>T shodo dab itsh fadee b́ wotiyaliru taan gac'eratste wee taan wic'atste, dab melakiyo it dek'iruwok'owe woshdek'at taan it dek'i, Krstos Iyesusi dek'iruwok'o woshat taan it dek'i. <verse eid="GAL 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 4:15"/>Haniyere shini it detsts geneú jamo aawoke b́fa'oni? B́ faleyal it ááwwotsi dab kishde'er it imetwok'o taa t tookon gaw wotitwe. <verse eid="GAL 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 4:16"/>Eshe, and ariko itsh t keewtsosheya it balangaro wotat t daatseyi?<verse eid="GAL 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 4:17"/>K'osh ashuwots it jangosh kic'atniye boshiyaniri, ernmó han bok'alir sheengoshaliye, bo geyirwo it noatse it k'aletwok'owonat boosh kúp'ar it shiyanitwok'owe. <verse eid="GAL 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 4:18"/>Sheeng k'os'osh kúp'o jam gizewon shenge, ernmó it kúp'an taa itnton t beyor s'uzosh wotk'aye. <verse eid="GAL 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 4:19"/>T nana'otso! Krstos it atse sháánon b́ be'efetsosh aani it jangosh na'it'i shambatse t fa'oni. <verse eid="GAL 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 4:20"/>Itsh eeg k'alo taash b́ geyituwok'o itdartsotse dandeyatniye t kic'i, it dagotetsere datseyar k'osh k'osh noon keewon tkeewink'ere aawk'owe t shuni.<verse eid="GAL 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Agarnat Saran ariyetso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 4:21"/>It nemosh keewetswotsi wotar beyo geyirwots aab taash keewwere, nemo bíetirwo shiyatsteya? <verse eid="GAL 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 4:22"/>S'ayin mas'aafwotsitse «Abraham git nana'úwotsi detsfe b́teshi, iko b́shwee gonuwatse wotat k'oshonu b́shwee mááts gon woteraawwatsna b́teshi» ett guut'ere. <verse eid="GAL 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 4:23"/>Gonu naay b́shuwe meets niwok'on b́wotefere gon woteraw naay b́shuwemó bísh jangit aap'etsok'one b́teshi. <verse eid="GAL 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 4:24"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:24 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 16:15">Aze. 16:15</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 21:2">21:2</ref> </char></note> Shints taarets taaretsnwere Sin guratstsu b wotor gutsmosh wotit nana'o shuwiruniye, biwere Agariye. <verse eid="GAL 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 4:25"/>Agaar Araawi datsatse fa'a Sin guro ariyetsuniye bteshi, mansh eshe andtsu Iyerusalemntoniye biariri, bi bnanaúwotsnton guutsmotse fa'úniye. <verse eid="GAL 4:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 4:26"/>Dambe darotsik wottsu Iyerusalemmó goniyaliye, biye no indiye.<verse eid="GAL 4:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GAL 4:27"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:27 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="ISA 54:1">Isa. 54:1</ref> </char>
    </note> «Nee nana'a shuraawne gene'úwowe!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GAL 4:27">Nee shuwosh id'r danaawne ‹ílll› eree,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GAL 4:27">Kenih detsts máátsuniyere</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GAL 4:27">K'azk'rets máátsu ay nana'o detsfane» ett guut'ere.<verse eid="GAL 4:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GAL 4:28"/>Tieshwotso! itwere Yisaak'kok'o jangiyets aap'i nana'úwots itne. <verse eid="GAL 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GAL 4:29"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:29 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 21:9">Aze. 21:9</ref> </char></note> Ernmó manoor meetson shuwetso Shayiron shuweetsman b́gishtsok'o hambetsoor mank'oyiye. <verse eid="GAL 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GAL 4:30"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:30 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 21:10">Aze. 21:10</ref> </char></note> Ernmó S'ayin mas'aafo bíetirwo eebi? S'ayin mas'aafo «Mááts gonu bshuts na'o gon woteraw máátsu bshutsonton towaar b́naarawotse gonu bnaaynton okaan kishwe» etfe. <verse eid="GAL 4:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GAL 4:31"/>Mansh eshe tieeshwotso, noo s'ayinu nana'úwots noone bako gonu nanaúwots noonaliye.<verse eid="GAL 4:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="GAL 5"/>
  <para style="s">Krstosn daatset nas' kesho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 5:1"/>Krstos nas'o noon b́kish nas'on nobeyishe. Mansh eshe kup'arr need'ore, aaninwere guutsmi k'ambariyots tipek'ayere.<verse eid="GAL 5:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 5:2"/>Hambe! taa P'awlos itsh tietetwo haniye, gofo it amal Krstos itsh eegor k'alratse, <verse eid="GAL 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 5:3"/>Gof ametu jamo «Nem jam s'eentso bín geyife» err aani bísh keewitwe, <verse eid="GAL 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 5:4"/>It nem koton kááw wotosh geyiru jamwots Krstosatse k'alewtserte, b́ s'aatotsnowere keshrtee. <verse eid="GAL 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 5:5"/>Noomó Ik' shayiron kááwi wotosh jángiyetso imnetiyone nokotiri. <verse eid="GAL 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 5:6"/>Iyesus Krstosn beetwosh shunon finitwo imnetiya boko gof amaa wee amk'azo eegoru oot'o imatse.<verse eid="GAL 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 5:7"/>It sha'a sha'o sheenge b́ teshi, eshe and arkeewosh it alerawok'o itn bazitso kone? <verse eid="GAL 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 5:8"/>Hank'o izan itn s'eegts Ik'oke waakaliye. <verse eid="GAL 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 5:9"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:9 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="1CO 5:6">1 K'or. 5:6</ref> </char></note> Manwere boot' shash muk'ú boot' jamo b shashitwoshe. <verse eid="GAL 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 5:10"/>Ernmó haniyere k'osho it gawirwo it deshawok'osh arikon wotde'er doonzats amanittwe, konworu it took s'adiitwo b́ beyal angsho dek'etwe.<verse eid="GAL 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 5:11"/>Tí eshwotso! taa andish b́ borfetsosh t nabirwo, «Kashosh gof amo geyife» etirwe wotiyal andish b́ borfetsosh eegishe t gisheyiri? Hank'o b́ wotitka wotiyal Krstos mask'aliyo ashuwotssh t'ug woterawnk'e b́ teshi. <verse eid="GAL 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 5:12"/>Eshe hanots iti dandiru ashaanots bogeyiyal gof amo s'uzi b́ woterawo boatso gato bowoshink'ere shúnfe.<verse eid="GAL 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 5:13"/>Tí eshwotso! it nas'o keshtswotsi it wotish s'egerte, ernmó iko k'oshosh shunon finowa bako nas'o it keshaan meets tewno s'eentsosh wotk'aye. <verse eid="GAL 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 5:14"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:14 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="LEV 19:18">Lew. 19:18</ref> </char></note> Nem jamo «K'osh asho n tokok'o woshde'er shune» eteets aap' ikon s'eenetwe. <verse eid="GAL 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 5:15"/>Ernmó it atsatseyo shac'eyatni it meeyeyiri wotiyal it atsatseyo it s'uweerawok'oo it atso korde'ere.<verse eid="GAL 5:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Shayironat meets beewo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 5:16"/>Eshe haniyak shayiron jisheyar it betka wotiyal, meets tewno s'eentsk'ayere. <verse eid="GAL 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 5:17"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:17 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ROM 7:15-23">Rom 7:15-23</ref> </char></note> Meets tewno shayiri tewnontotoniye b́ wed'eyiri, shayiri tewnonu meets tewnontoniye b́wed'eyri, mansh meetsonat shayiron boats atsewo bo wed'eyiri, eshe it geyirwo k'alo falratste. <verse eid="GAL 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 5:18"/>Shayirona it jiisheyiri wotink'eremó nemosh keweyirwotsi woterawnk'te.<verse eid="GAL 5:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 5:19"/>Meetsi finwots daneknee, boowere wido, kiimwoto, shiraats jintsi woto, <verse eid="GAL 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 5:20"/>Woteraw ik'wotsi ik'iyo, atetsi woto, balangar woto, mooshewo, fayo, okooro, b́took shuno, k'aleyo, weeri gondo, <verse eid="GAL 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 5:21"/>ash een shit'o, másho, weral t'oola, hanotsi artswotsiye, haniyere shin itatso korde'ere tiettsok'on andoor aaniyi it atso korde'ere etirwe, hanotsk'o wotts keewwotsi finit ashuwots Ik'i mengtstu naaratsne.<verse eid="GAL 5:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 5:22"/>S'ayin shayiri shuwonmó shuno, geneúwo, jeeno, k'amo, sheengo, doowo, amanetso woto, <verse eid="GAL 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 5:23"/>Dingato woto, b́took keewoniye. Hanotsk'o keewwotsi k'efit nemo aaliye, <verse eid="GAL 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 5:24"/>Krstos Iyesusk wotts ashuwots meetso b́gusiyontonat b́tewnonton mesk'eliyats jitk'rerne. <verse eid="GAL 5:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 5:25"/>Shayirona nobeeyiri wotiyal shayiron jishewone. <verse eid="GAL 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 5:26"/>Iko k'osho gondosh tuuzr noatsatsewo okoorefetsr datsmec'ro it'k'ayone.<verse eid="GAL 5:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="GAL 6"/>
  <para style="s">Bí atsatseyo tep'eyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 6:1"/>Ti eshwotso! ash iko morro finar b́daatsetka wotiyal shayiri ash wottswots it han naari asho maac' nefon káátswere, ernmó neewere man naari fadewots ndihrawok'o ntooko korde'e. <verse eid="GAL 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 6:2"/>Ititsi ik ikets k'oshoko kuri mango kurde'e, mank'oon Krstos nemo s'eentsitute. <verse eid="GAL 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 6:3"/>Asho konwor k'oshwotsiyere b́k'ants keewo b́deshawo «Taa k'oshwotsiyere bogfe» err biasabiyal b́ tookoniye b́ ant'elciri. <verse eid="GAL 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 6:4"/>Asho ik ikon b́took fino shu'arr fadbe'e, maniyere il b́ tooko k'oshwotsnton nohiyo b́woterawon b́ tooku s'uz bín b́ it'et keewo daatsitwe. <verse eid="GAL 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 6:5"/>Ik ik asho b́ took kuro kurdek'o bísh geyife.<verse eid="GAL 6:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 6:6"/>Doo shishyi aap'tso daniru asho bín daniyirwonton sheeng keew jamó kayde'e.<verse eid="GAL 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 6:7"/>It tooko ant'elck'ayere, asho b́k'es'et b́ shooktso b́wottsotse Ik'ats kasho faleratse. <verse eid="GAL 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 6:8"/>B́ meetso gene'úshosh shookirwo b́meetsatse k'iro k'es'etwe, shayiro geneúshosh shooketwo shayiratse dúre dúri kasho k'es'etwe. <verse eid="GAL 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 6:9"/>Maac'o k'ut'dek'o no k'azetka wotiyal b́dúro b́bodor mááy katso nokakwitwotse sheeng fino finosh maawk'ayone. <verse eid="GAL 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 6:10"/>And wotts aawo nodetstsotse ash jamwotssh bítsnor amaniru ashuwotssh sheeng keewo k'alwone.<verse eid="GAL 6:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">S'uwori izonat jamon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 6:11"/>Aawk'o een een fidalwotsn han t kíshoon t guut'tsok'o s'iilere! <verse eid="GAL 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 6:12"/>Gofo itametwok'o iti kic'irwots úratse sheeng araar be'ewo geyiru ashuwotsiye. Han k'alirwotswere Krstos mask'aliyatse tuutson gishewo boats b́boraawok'owa ettniye. <verse eid="GAL 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 6:13"/>Boohe it meetsats it'osha ettni gofo itametwok'owo bogeyiri bako gof amtswotswor dab botokish nemo koratsne. <verse eid="GAL 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 6:14"/>Nodoonz Iyesus Krstos mask'aliyoniyere okoon k'oshon it'o tiatse wokowe, jit hanatse tuutson datso tiatse k'alewtsere, taawere datsatse k'alewtsere. <verse eid="GAL 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 6:15"/>Mansh gof amonu gof amk'azonu eegor k'alratse, k'alitwoniyere azeets handro wotoniye. <verse eid="GAL 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 6:16"/>Memeri shuutso shoyiru jamwotsnat Ik'i jir wotts Isra'el ashuwotssh jeenonat mhretiyon wotowe.<verse eid="GAL 6:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 6:17"/>Ti atsatse fa'a jot'eetsi shoro Iyesusk twottsok'o b́kitsirwotse haniyak konúwor taan kic'ik'aye.<verse eid="GAL 6:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 6:18"/>Ti eshwotso! nodoonz Iyesus Krstos s'aato it shayironton wotowe! Amen.<verse eid="GAL 6:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 6"/>
</usx>
